# Save/load stage 1 (tests/save/save_new.toml): new game, the combat_loot route and fight, readings of the
# status screen, then the game's own save: options menu > Quit > "save and return to the Title Screen" > Yes.

# Title, storage prompt, NEW GAME, Kendal, solo game; skip the intro cutscene until play starts
500 tap Return
700 tap Return
850 tap Return
1000 tap Return
1250 tap Return
1350 tap Return
1500 tap Return
1650 tap Return
1800 repeat 60 until gameplay tap Return

# Route to the lizardmen, fight with potions (Q), pick up drops (E); then a pick-up sweep
# The 5 Small Red Potions (LB, Q) are drunk from +6300, one every 700 frames: drunk from the start of the fight
# they were gone by +5300 with HP still near full, and the character could die late in the fight or in the
# sweep (K24: 4 deaths in 64 runs, all at +9740..+10400; HP measured on the HUD bar)
@menu#2+90 tap Return
@menu#2+600 down W
@menu#2+660 tap Return
@menu#2+720 tap Return
@menu#2+780 tap Return
@menu#2+840 tap Return
@menu#2+900 tap Return
@menu#2+900 tap MouseMiddle
